# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — Integrated Hospital Management System (HMS) + Patient Mobile App

> Paste everything below into your AI coding tool (Claude Code, Cursor, etc.). It is derived line-by-line from "Hospital Management – Functional Detailed Requirements & Input–Output Flows". Section numbers (§) refer to that document.

