## 1. TECH STACK (propose, then proceed unless I object)

- Mobile: Flutter (or React Native) with biometric auth, push (FCM/APNs), deep links, offline-safe empty/error states.
- Web portal: React + TypeScript (Next.js), component library, accessible (WCAG 2.1 AA).
- Backend: Node.js (NestJS) or Python (FastAPI); PostgreSQL; Redis (queues, slot holds, rate limits); object storage (S3-compatible) for documents; message queue/worker for notifications & integrations.
- Auth: OAuth2/OIDC-style JWT + refresh, RBAC + ABAC (branch/department scope), MFA (TOTP/SMS) for staff/admin.
- Infra: Docker, CI/CD, environment config, migrations, seed scripts, OpenAPI docs, structured logging, health/monitoring endpoints.
- Multi-branch data model from day one (branch_id on all operational entities), even though multi-branch UI is Phase 3.

