## 2. ACTORS & ROLES (§2) — implement as configurable RBAC roles

| Role | Capabilities (all subject to configured permissions) |
|---|---|
| Patient | Register, manage profile, book appointments, view own records, pay bills, book tests, view prescriptions, request emergency help |
