| Laboratory staff | Blood bank, diagnostic test reports, notices; payroll view where authorized |
| Pharmacist | Medicine categories, inventory, prescriptions/bills, notices |
| Accountant | Invoices, payments, payroll, financial accounts |
| Administrator | Departments, users, roles, dashboards, billing, payroll, settings, notices, documents |
| HR / Hiring team | Vacancies, candidate applications, interviews, status updates, offer tracking |
| Publisher / Approver | Create, review, approve and publish notices or campaigns within assigned scope |
