## 3. SHARED END-TO-END PATIENT JOURNEY (§3) — must work as one connected flow

| Stage | Inputs | Action | Output |
|---|---|---|---|
| Discover | Branch, specialty/service, doctor name | Search directory, show matching services/doctors | Results + profile |
| Register | User ID, mobile, email, password, consent | Validate identity fields; verify mobile as configured; create account | Patient account + confirmation |
